        <mxCell id="nMyddl20dA7UI9YyAWtk-41" value="when we reserve the ticket, we change the status in res db to in progress&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;and copy that seat in gemfire cluster and lock it for 10 mins so that no other person can&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;have this seat, once its booked, remove it from redis and update the status to reserved&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;else after 10 mins update the staus to open&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="nMyddl20dA7UI9YyAWtk-1" vertex="1">
