        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b-jtBINz3-ixhz1Lf9aJ-28" value="when A send a message, message body will contain to, from and message, this request is taken by SessionService, which call user db to find the chat server&lt;div&gt;by which user B is connected, session service send a sent receipt to user A, then&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;SessionService forward this request to B&#39;s chat server, B&#39;s chat server forward this message to B and send an ack back to session service&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;session service forward this ack to A&#39;s chat server and A&#39;s chat server forward delivered notification to A&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;When B opens his whatsapp and read the chat, another read notification sent to B&#39;s chat server and same process repeats&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;When A send a message in a group, this request is taken by session service which calls group service to find out how many users are connected to this group id&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;and then call user db to find out which user is connected to which chat server , group service meanwhile saves the chat message in the queue&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;in case of failure of group service message whould not be lost&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;once user A find out how many userid and its chat server it process the message in the same&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Last seen&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;whenever user does anything, such as readin a message, scrolling over the group. Last seenService gets called and it saves timestamp with user id&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;in seen db, when another user want to check the status of snother user then last seen service calls the seen db and check when was the last time B was available&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;here Last seen service has to decide to show online or last seen timestamp, so if user B timestamp is 30 second before then Last seen service will show the timestamp&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;else it will show online&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="b-jtBINz3-ixhz1Lf9aJ-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-185" y="690" width="910" height="290" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b-jtBINz3-ixhz1Lf9aJ-29" value="user&lt;div&gt;db&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;" vertex="1" parent="b-jtBINz3-ixhz1Lf9aJ-1">
