        <mxCell id="6UFmMaZe4tCL72Od4W4e-42" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;We can have as many write servers as we want and send the request based on consistent hashing algorithms and each servers saves each write in its own database&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;these servers send events to kafka cluster as soon as they receive write requests, now another&amp;nbsp; set of servers pick the events from kafka and saves latest write from each server to&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;vector database and saves all the documents sorted based on location indexes in the document database, now another set of servers combine all the write request in sequence and if any write request is missing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;then call the server connected database and fetch missing write request and apply to the result and send it to another users&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="6UFmMaZe4tCL72Od4W4e-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-110" y="-300" width="1520" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6UFmMaZe4tCL72Od4W4e-43" value="servers" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="6UFmMaZe4tCL72Od4W4e-1">
          <mxGeometry x="960" y="150" width="120" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6UFmMaZe4tCL72Od4W4e-44" value="servers" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="6UFmMaZe4tCL72Od4W4e-1">
          <mxGeometry x="970" y="150" width="120" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
